ding spans street-level and lower-ground retail levels, and current floor filters include L1, L2, L3 and lower levels LL1 through LL3. That vertical arrangement feels more compact than a suburban mega mall even though the tenant mix is spread through several floors. A visitor with a clear purpose can browse efficiently, while someone attending an exhibition or dining reservation may spend most of the visit in only one or two parts of the property. Service is a defining feature. Union Square advertises concierge, VIP and loyalty services as well as parking and valet support. The concierge counter is at the Level 1 Dong Khoi entrance and is currently listed as operating from 09:00 to 22:00 daily, which is longer than the mall's published retail opening window. Travelers who need directions inside the building, assistance locating a tenant or information about current exhibitions can use that desk rather than searching floor by floor. Parking is unusually substantial for such a central location. Union Square publishes a three-storey underground garage on levels B4 to B6 with capacity for 190 cars and 2,300 motorcycles. The parking facility is described as available 24 hours a day, while parking validation and valet service run from 10:00 to midnight. Entrance details can change during construction or operational adjustments, so drivers should follow current signage rather than an old saved route. For most tourists, walking or ride-hailing is easier than self-driving because Dong Khoi is already part of the central sightseeing zone. The mall can function as a comfortable air-conditioned pause between outdoor activities, especially during midday heat or heavy rain. Its location also makes it useful as a meeting point: a group can meet at the concierge entrance, browse separately, then regroup for coffee or dinner without committing to a long cross-city journey. There is no general admission fee. Costs ... Ward, District 1, Ho Chi Minh City, Vietnam Monday10:00–21:00 Tuesday10:00–21:00 Wednesday10:00–21:00 Thursday10:00–21:00 Friday10:00–21:00 Saturday10:00–21:00 Sunday10:00–21:00 Concierge services run longer than retail hours; individual restaurants and events may follow separate schedules. Opening information ↗ Checked 2026-09-15 Location Ho Chi Minh City · Vietnam Open in Maps ↗ + − Leaflet © OpenStreetMap contributors Find this place Union Square A premium retail, dining and cultural destination on Dong Khoi Street in the central downtown area. Get directions ↗ Official website ↗ Address 171 Dong Khoi Street, Ben Nghe Ward, District 1, Ho Chi Minh City, Vietnam Transport Walking or ride-hailing is easiest for most visitors already in central Ho Chi Minh City; a large underground garage is also available. Also useful The concierge counter at the Level 1 Dong Khoi entrance operates beyond the mall retail hours and can help with current tenant or event information. Visit duration Allow around 1–2.5 hours, longer with a meal or exhibition. Accessibility Specific...--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nGEUMSAM BRAND (https://geumsam.com/pages/geumsam-brand)\nciteturn313search12 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: 6 days ago; Content type: text/plain; \n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nWine Paris 2026 (https://winespace.fr/en/events/wine-paris-2026)\nciteturn313search13 [wordlim: 200] Published: 8 months ago; Crawled: 3 weeks ago; Content type: text/plain; \n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nGUERLAIN boutiques and points of sale - Vietnam (https://stores.guerlain.com/sa/en_SA/vietnam)\nciteturn313search14 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: 6 months ago; Content type: text/plain; \n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nVincom Center Dong Khoi HCMC: Luxury Shopping Mall & Brands - Grooviet (https://grooviet.com/destination/vincom-center-dong-khoi-hcmc/)\nciteturn313